			"text":"◈ Model Quantization\n— INT8/INT4 inference\n— GGUF format (llama.cpp)\n— 4x memory reduction\n— Minimal quality tradeoff",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":2990,
			"y":520,
			"width":260,
			"height":90,
			"color":"#10b981"
		},
		{
			"id":"g_compress",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"◈ Context Compression\n— LLMLingua token pruning\n— Selective history inclusion\n— Summarization compression\n— 60% token reduction target",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":2990,
			"y":640,
			"width":260,
			"height":90,
			"color":"#10b981"
		},
		{
			"id":"g_spot",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"◈ Spot / Preemptible Infra\n— AWS Spot for inference\n— Checkpointing for recovery\n— 60-90% cost vs on-demand\n— Stateless request design",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":2990,
			"y":760,
			"width":260,
			"height":90,
			"color":"#10b981"
		},
		{
			"id":"g_math_cost",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"🔷 Cost Modeling Math\n— C = (input_tok × p_in) + (output_tok × p_out)\n— ROI = (cost_saved - infra_cost) / infra_cost\n— Break-even analysis\n— TCO: total cost of ownership",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":2990,
			"y":880,
			"width":260,
			"height":100,
			"color":"#6c3483"
		}
	],
